msgid "1Panel"
msgstr "1Panel"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Updated 1Panel settings."
msgstr "1Panel 設定已更新。"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Partial"
msgstr "部分執行"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"

msgid "1Panel is a Linux server management panel. The settings below are used by the Install button, which downloads the official upstream release from the 1Panel CDN and runs the official installer non-interactively. Save the settings first, then use the buttons below to install and manage the panel. The panel itself (app store, websites, databases) is managed in the native 1Panel interface."
msgstr "1Panel 是 Linux 伺服器管理面板。下方設定供「安裝」按鈕使用——從 1Panel CDN 下載官方發行包並靜默執行官方安裝指令碼。先儲存設定，再用下方按鈕安裝和管理面板。面板自身（應用商店、網站、資料庫等）請在 1Panel 原生介面管理。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Service status"
msgstr "服務狀態"

msgid "Installed version"
msgstr "已裝版本"

msgid "Latest version"
msgstr "最新版本"

msgid "Update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服務"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Automatically manage the panel services from OMV. On Apply the 1Panel systemd services are enabled and started (when installed). Disabling the service stops and disables them on Apply. The panel is installed and uninstalled with the buttons below."
msgstr "由 OMV 自動管理面板服務：點「套用」時啟用並啟動 1Panel 的 systemd 服務（已安裝時）。停用服務會在「套用」時停止並停用。面板的安裝與解除安裝請用下方按鈕。"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安裝"

msgid "Install directory"
msgstr "安裝目錄"

msgid "Base directory for the 1Panel installation. The panel data is stored in a subdirectory named 1panel and is kept when the panel is uninstalled."
msgstr "1Panel 的安裝基礎目錄。面板資料存放在名為 1panel 的子目錄中，解除安裝面板時該資料目錄會保留。"

msgid "Panel language"
msgstr "面板語言"

msgid "Language of the native 1Panel interface, set at installation time."
msgstr "1Panel 原生介面語言，安裝時設定。"

msgid "English"
msgstr "English"

msgid "中文"
msgstr "中文"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "帳號"

msgid "Web port"
msgstr "Web 連接埠"

msgid "Port of the 1Panel web interface, set at installation time."
msgstr "1Panel 網頁介面連接埠，安裝時設定。"

msgid "Secure entrance"
msgstr "安全入口"

msgid "Secret path of the web interface, 3-30 characters (letters, digits, underscore). Generated randomly on plugin installation. Changing it after installation requires the native 1Panel interface."
msgstr "網頁介面的秘密路徑，3-30 個字元（字母、數字、底線）。安裝外掛時隨機產生。裝後修改需到 1Panel 原生介面。"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "使用者名稱"

msgid "Panel administrator name, 3-30 characters (letters, digits, underscore). Set at installation time. Changing it afterwards requires the native 1Panel interface."
msgstr "面板管理員名稱，3-30 個字元（字母、數字、底線）。安裝時設定。裝後修改需到 1Panel 原生介面。"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

msgid "Panel password, 8-30 characters (letters, digits and _!@#$%*,.? only). Generated randomly on plugin installation. Note it down before installing - it is masked afterwards. Changing it afterwards requires the native 1Panel interface."
msgstr "面板密碼，8-30 個字元（僅限字母、數字與 _!@#$%*,.?）。安裝外掛時隨機產生。安裝前請先記下——裝後會以遮罩顯示。裝後修改需到 1Panel 原生介面。"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "安裝"

msgid "Do you really want to install 1Panel? The official release is downloaded from the 1Panel CDN and installed with the settings saved above. Docker installation and daemon.json changes are disabled."
msgstr "確實要安裝 1Panel 嗎？將從 1Panel CDN 下載官方發行包，並依上方已儲存的設定靜默安裝。不會安裝 Docker，也不會改動 daemon.json。"

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升級"

msgid "Do you really want to upgrade 1Panel online? The official upgrade command is executed. Read the upstream release notes before major upgrades."
msgstr "確實要線上升級 1Panel 嗎？將執行官方升級指令。大版本升級前請先閱讀上游發布說明。"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "解除安裝"

msgid "Do you really want to uninstall 1Panel? The services are stopped and the binaries are removed. The panel data directory is KEPT, but websites, databases and app containers it manages may stop working. This cannot be undone automatically."
msgstr "確實要解除安裝 1Panel 嗎？服務將被停止，二進位檔案將被移除。面板資料目錄會保留，但其管理的網站、資料庫與應用容器可能停止運作。此操作無法自動復原。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Do you really want to stop the 1Panel services? The web interface becomes unavailable until you start the panel again."
msgstr "確實要停止 1Panel 服務嗎？在重新啟動面板之前網頁介面將無法使用。"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

msgid "View user info"
msgstr "檢視使用者資訊"

msgid "View logs"
msgstr "檢視日誌"

msgid "Open 1Panel"
msgstr "開啟 1Panel"

msgid "1Panel install output"
msgstr "1Panel 安裝輸出"

msgid "1Panel upgrade output"
msgstr "1Panel 升級輸出"

msgid "1Panel uninstall output"
msgstr "1Panel 解除安裝輸出"

msgid "1Panel start output"
msgstr "1Panel 啟動輸出"

msgid "1Panel stop output"
msgstr "1Panel 停止輸出"

msgid "1Panel restart output"
msgstr "1Panel 重新啟動輸出"

msgid "1Panel user info"
msgstr "1Panel 使用者資訊"

msgid "1Panel logs"
msgstr "1Panel 日誌"
